{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：S01、S05等短停留段落的信息密度偏高，感受词和比喻有时叠加过多，扫读不如X轻松。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y虽然更需要观众投入注意力，但【】突出关键心理节点、感受按音乐实际出现时机展开，让观众既能抓住每段核心，又能感受到情绪如何一步步变化。尤其从害怕暴露需要、享受亲近，到害怕失去、意识到彼此需要，再到不再隐藏喜欢，人物动机和前后联系都比X更充分，音乐感受也更细腻具体。X的优势是扫读轻松、表达利落，但综合实际观看体验，Y提供的理解和情感体验更多。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4d63dd7d-8ce4-43eb-91b0-0e8683752914", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T154404839964Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.438, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:45:13.291999+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "37b77301c9a9643f1c816f171074c8f0695d269b0a47273f64b0b40e35ad7ca2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee53